<title>UK: JP Morgan adds 200 mln Swiss francs to 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan adds 200 mln Swiss francs to 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased, joint lead managers UBS Zurich and SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J.P. MORGAN &amp; CO INC</p>
<p> AMT  * 200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.00	MATURITY    27.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.05    PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  REOFFER    =	   EOS	   04.AUG.97</p>
<p> NOTES   *  ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED 28.JAN.97, ISSUE NOW TOTALS 600 MLN</p>
<p>		SWISS FRANCS. REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
